== 3. The DIVERGED case — openOODA master ==

master holds exactly two commits ooda lacks: 04414c6 (iso milestone-2)
and 5349158 (iso ELF loader) — the ORIGINAL iso-lane SHAs. ooda carries
the same content re-committed as ddc9a24/fae2fe6 (landed via the iso
owner's own push during the wip rebase). Proof of content equivalence:
`git diff refs/remotes/github/master refs/remotes/github/ooda -- iso/`
is empty. The remaining tree difference is ooda's 18 ahead commits, so
the divergence is SHA-identity only — master loses nothing by being
reset to ooda.

== 4. Reconcile proposals (proposal-only; manager executes) ==

- openOODA master: force-push ooda tip onto master
  (`git push github +ooda:master`). The 2 orphan SHAs carry no unique
  content; a merge would preserve redundant history.
- All other rows: plain fast-forward `git push github ooda:master`
  and/or `ooda:main` — 15 FF-able refs across 8 repos.
- std master + status main already SYNC; no action needed.
- Stale tracking refs (stale=1): none observed this run.

Raw tool output is deterministic given remote state; rerun the binary
to refresh. drift=9 repos audited.
